        Y: 12.398615837097168
        Z: 8.03750991821289
      Focal Shape Fixed Size: true
      Focal Shape Size: 0.05000000074505806
      Invert Z Axis: false
      Name: Current View
      Near Clip Distance: 0.009999999776482582
      Pitch: 0.6200364828109741
      Target Frame: <Fixed Frame>
      Value: Orbit (rviz)
      Yaw: 1.5854352712631226
    Saved: ~
